{"id":"8fd697c971f82640","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmCProof.md","title":"FmCProof","display":"FmCProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmCProof","parameters":["t","z23"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmCProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>t</span><span>z23</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>t</code>、<code>z23</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmCProof t z23)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z26\n  (exists z27\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z23 z26)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z23 z27)\n        (and\n          (= z27 t)\n          (forall z24 (implies (in z24 z26) (exists z25 (and (@ App z23 z24 z25) (@ FmCRow z23 z24 z25))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebaacda55a4991ea\" href=\"?note=ebaacda55a4991ea\" title=\"ZFC_FmCRow\">FmCRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmCProof t z23)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmCRow|FmCRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmCRow","status":"resolved","id":"ebaacda55a4991ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmCRow|FmCRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Last","status":"resolved","id":"d72dedf3d7200b4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmCRow|FmCRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","status":"resolved","id":"ae1f2bbcc1dff983","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmCRow|FmCRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":982,"backlinks":[{"id":"43d22035e7796b1d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmCProof|FmCProof]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_FmCProof|FmCProof]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","ebaacda55a4991ea","d72dedf3d7200b4b","ae1f2bbcc1dff